revision 66618
shortdesc PDF Math Symbols -- various drawn mathematical symbols
longdesc This package defines a handful of mathematical symbols many of
longdesc which are implemented via PDF's builtin drawing utility. It is
longdesc intended for use with pdfTeX and LuaTeX and is supported by
longdesc XeTeX to a lesser extent. Among the symbols it defines are some
longdesc variants of commonly used ones, as well as more obscure symbols
longdesc which cannot be as easily found in other TeX or LaTeX packages.
